  "question": "What\u2019s the nearest restaurant encountered heading toward Suzanne Barrett Justis Fine Art, Kingsport, TN from Gem Mountain Gemstone Mine, Spruce Pine, NC?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-82.050287 35.872594)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-82.560228 36.546269)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'restaurant'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-82.050287 35.872594)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-82.050287 35.872594)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
